[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0101","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0101.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0037","title":"FreeBSD Metamail 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统自带的 metamail 邮件处理工具存在命令注入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的 MIME 邮件消息，在消息头中嵌入恶意命令。当用户使用 metamail 处理该恶意邮件时，漏洞被触发，导致以当前用户权限在系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，但需要用户主动触发邮件处理操作，影响范围较广。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0037"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-05-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:25Z","remediation":"升级 metamail 至已过滤 MIME 邮件头 shell 元字符的修补版本；若无法升级，建议直接卸载 metamail（pkg delete metamail）并改用 procmail 或 maildrop 等现代邮件处理工具替代；同时配置邮件客户端不自动调用 metamail 处理来自不可信来源的 MIME 邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0037"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1530","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1530.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1449","title":"Sun SunOS 4.1.4 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SunOS 4.1.4 系统（运行于 Sparc 20 工作站）的 TCX 帧缓冲设备驱动中存在拒绝服务漏洞。本地攻击者通过读取 /dev/tcx0 设备文件即可触发内核恐慌（kernel panic），导致系统崩溃。该漏洞无需特殊权限即可利用，攻击者仅需具备本地访问权限即可造成系统不可用。受影响系统为 SunOS 4.1.4 及可能更早版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1449"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-05-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:27Z","remediation":"SunOS 4.1.4 已停止维护，无官方补丁。若系统未使用 TCX 帧缓冲硬件，直接删除 /dev/tcx0 设备文件（rm /dev/tcx0）即可根除风险；如需保留设备，将文件权限修改为仅 root 可读写（chmod 600 /dev/tcx0），阻止普通用户读取触发内核崩溃。长期建议升级至 Solaris 7 或更高版本操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://oamk.fi/~jukkao/bugtraq/before-971202/0498.html","http://www.insecure.org/sploits/sunos.dev.tcx0.write.wierd.shit.to.device.bug.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc228e85e595b2c95bda5544193864b06177c050/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1449.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1449","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1449.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9849013fb49e540f15cffd30644fcdcb875c1d4f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1449.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h7hf-jwxg-6q4v/GHSA-h7hf-jwxg-6q4v.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x85000/84488/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1449.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154300_154400.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1530.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1254","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1254.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1191","title":"Sun Solaris chkey 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.5.1 及之前版本中的 chkey 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户通过向该命令传递超长命令行参数，可触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。攻击者无需任何系统权限即可利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1191"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-05-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"应用 Sun 安全公告 144 中提供的补丁，升级 Solaris 系统至已修复版本，或限制 chkey 命令的 setuid 权限以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2024-06-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167418335&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/144","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/207","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7442.php"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1254.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1264","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1264.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1402","title":"Sun Solaris FreeBSD UNIX 域套接字访问权限忽略漏洞","description":"UNIX 域套接字的访问权限在 Solaris 2.x、SunOS 4.x 以及 4.4BSD 之前的 BSD 衍生操作系统中未被正确强制执行，导致本地用户可连接到该套接字，进而可能干扰或控制使用该套接字的程序操作。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 3.1、Solaris 2.6 等系统，需要本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。由于年代久远，相关系统已不再维护，建议升级至支持操作系统。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1402"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-05-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:21Z","remediation":"升级到 Solaris 7 及以上版本（Solaris 8 后已修正此问题），或升级 FreeBSD 到 4.0 以上。对于无法升级的老系统，将 UNIX domain socket 文件放置于权限设为 0700 的专用目录中，避免放在 /tmp 等全局可读位置，利用目录权限限制未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167418317&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602248718482&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7172.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/456","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19346","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/51c6246292cd60528ab00cc0df9c1fcdee341e7e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1402.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1402","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1402.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c772403a169ecbfd38454bff1a2ab85bf6a7d51/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1402.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rq2v-6234-j5f5/GHSA-rq2v-6234-j5f5.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154300_154400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000171.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e75cef1b-ba3b-4496-a7f1-c5f8aada3bca.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1402.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--e75cef1b-ba3b-4496-a7f1-c5f8aada3bca.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1264.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1418","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1418.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1232","title":"SGI IRIX day5datacopier 不可信搜索路径漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.2 系统中的 day5datacopier 工具存在不可信搜索路径漏洞。本地攻击者可通过修改 PATH 环境变量，使其指向恶意的 cp 程序，当 day5datacopier 被触发执行时，系统将加载攻击者预设的恶意程序而非系统原生的 cp 命令，从而导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地访问权限方可利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1232"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:59Z","remediation":"升级 SGI IRIX 至 6.3 或更高版本，或在 day5datacopier 脚本中使用 cp 命令的绝对路径 /bin/cp 替代相对路径 cp，同时限制普通用户对关键脚本的写权限并移除当前目录（.）从 PATH 环境变量中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420994&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/8559","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3316"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1418.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1355","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1355.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1141","title":"Ascom Timeplex 路由器调试模式信息泄露漏洞","description":"Ascom Timeplex 路由器存在调试模式信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，仅通过发送特定序列的 CTRL-D 控制字符即可使目标路由器进入调试模式，从而获取敏感配置信息或执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响 Ascom Timeplex 系列路由器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1141"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-05-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:48Z","remediation":"此漏洞影响已停止支持的旧版 Ascom Timeplex 路由器。建议立即更换为受支持的现代路由器设备；如无法更换，应严格限制管理接口的网络访问（仅允许受信任 IP 通过专用管理 VLAN 访问），在边界防火墙上封锁路由器管理端口（如 Telnet 23/UDP 161 SNMP），并禁用不必要的远程管理服务以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420981&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1824","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1141.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1141","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1141.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9b79b5eac5a874eeb91f0d9e37084feed8b830f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1141.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m26q-6j78-pcw5/GHSA-m26q-6j78-pcw5.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88528/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1141.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154300_154400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b1589dcb-a487-4cbe-ad69-2015283a27d6.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1355.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1245","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1245.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0962","title":"HP-UX passwd 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统自带的 passwd 命令在处理命令行参数时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于未对用户输入长度进行充分校验，本地攻击者可通过向 passwd 命令传递超长参数触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞允许无特权的本地用户完全控制受影响的 HP-UX 系统，属于典型的本地权限提升漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0962"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-05-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 HP-UX 安全公告 HPSBUX9701-045 中提供的补丁程序，或升级到修复此漏洞的 HP-UX 版本。如无法立即升级，建议限制非必要用户的本地登录权限，并监控 passwd 命令的异常调用行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T03:32:33Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6415","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9701-045"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1245.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1248","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1248.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1184","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9155,\"outputTokens\":25,\"totalTokens\":10844}}","description":"Elm 邮件客户端 2.4 及更早版本（含 2.3）在处理环境变量时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该程序在读取 TERM 环境变量时未对输入长度进行边界校验，本地用户可通过在 shell 中设置超长的 TERM 环境变量后启动 Elm，使恶意构造的数据覆盖栈上返回地址，从而以 Elm 进程权限（通常为目标用户权限）执行任意代码并提升本地权限。该漏洞影响采用受影响版本 Elm 的本地系统用户，攻击前提是攻击者已拥有目标系统的本地登录权限，利用方式简单，仅需设置环境变量即可触发，CVSS 基础评分约为 4.6，危害等级为中。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1184"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-05-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:53Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Elm 2.5 或更高版本（该版本已修复 TERM 环境变量缓冲区溢出）。如无法立即升级，可在 /etc/profile 或用户 shell 配置中对 TERM 变量长度做限制（如 truncate 至 40 字符以内），并避免以特权用户运行 elm；临时缓解可在 setuid 环境中用 env -u TERM 方式启动，移除 TERM 变量传入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420967&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420970&w=2","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22836","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d69ab21f83909859ed75ab8ba3287f9f633b856f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1184.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1184","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1184.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c9ec7f26a52f816468b636e23146049097db5070/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1184.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f43f79d7ee652229af6058b1c98133bb5bbc17fb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7jcx-v99p-6xwr/GHSA-7jcx-v99p-6xwr.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83053/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1184.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154300_154400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000167.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1248.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1246","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1246.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1158","title":"Sun Solaris PAM 模块缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统的可插拔认证模块（PAM）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当用户通过 passwd、yppasswd、nispasswd 等程序修改密码时，会调用存在缺陷的 PAM 模块进行认证处理，由于对输入数据长度缺乏充分校验，本地攻击者可构造特制的认证请求触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.3/2.4/2.5/2.5.1 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。官方建议安装 Sun 提供的安全补丁或升级系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1158"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-05-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:50Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris 系统至 2.6 及以上版本，该版本已修复 PAM 模块和 unix_scheme 的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可限制本地用户对 passwd/yppasswd/nispasswd 的 SUID 执行权限（chmod 4750 /bin/passwd），并安装 Sun 官方补丁 ID 103670-03（SPARC）或 103671-03（x86）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/139&type=0&nav=sec.sba","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/341","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1158.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1158","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1158.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1158.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-m3h3-j5g8-pq9j/GHSA-m3h3-j5g8-pq9j.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83036/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154300_154400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000166.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1158.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1246.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1246.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1246.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1454","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1454.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1286","title":"SGI IRIX addnetpr 本地符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.2 及更早版本中的 addnetpr 工具（/usr/lib/netaddpr）存在本地权限提升漏洞。该程序在处理临时文件时未正确检查符号链接，本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接指向任意系统文件，诱导程序以高权限覆写目标文件，从而修改关键系统配置或二进制文件，最终获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。利用前提是攻击者拥有本地账户。，最终获取 root 权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1286"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-05-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:06Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于已停止维护的 SGI IRIX 6.2 及更早版本中，厂商已不再提供安全更新。建议立即升级至受支持的现代操作系统（如 Linux 或 BSD 系列），彻底弃用 SGI IRIX 系统。如无法立即迁移，应移除 /usr/lib/addnetpr 的 SUID 权限（chmod 0755 /usr/lib/addnetpr），并限制可执行该程序的用户组范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420927&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/8560","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/330","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1433","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1286.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1286","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1286.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1286.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-x5rx-8ccg-vqfm/GHSA-x5rx-8ccg-vqfm.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1286.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000164.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ef0f8546-b376-4711-8b28-ce33c3173199.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/be7ad03fdf3a412f0fd57a25f1732dc0ecfb1cb3/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1454.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1267","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1267.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1410","title":"SGI IRIX addnetpr 本地提权漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 操作系统 5.3 及 6.2 版本中的 addnetpr（/usr/lib/netaddpr）工具存在任意文件写入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击方式，在打印机临时文件创建过程中将目标文件链接为系统关键文件，导致任意文件覆盖，进而实现本地权限提升获取 root 权限。该漏洞利用条件为拥有本地 shell 访问权限，无需额外认证。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1410"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-05-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:22Z","remediation":"升级 IRIX 至 6.5 或更高版本，或安装 SGI 提供的安全补丁 4841。如无法升级，可移除 addnetpr 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/lib/netaddpr）并限制可执行用户组，作为临时缓解措施。由于 IRIX 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420927&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/330","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19260","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/51c6246292cd60528ab00cc0df9c1fcdee341e7e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1410.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1410","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1410.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c7724