以 root 权限写入日志，从而覆盖任意文件并提升至 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.4 系统，需本地 shell 访问权限方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1398"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-05-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:21Z","remediation":"SGI IRIX 已停止维护多年，官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即移除 xfsdump 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/xfsdump），防止普通用户通过符号链接攻击提升至 root 权限。同时将备份日志目录 /var/log/xfsdump 的权限改为 750 并限制属主为 root，或改用不受影响的备份工具（如 tar）替代 xfsdump。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420921&w=2","http://www.insecure.org/sploits/irix.xfsdump.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/472","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19358","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1398.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1398","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1398.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c772403a169ecbfd38454bff1a2ab85bf6a7d51/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1398.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r7r6-4c9p-66r6/GHSA-r7r6-4c9p-66r6.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/472/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bb778dc8-1640-452d-8f3e-7d15f90931af.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000162.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1398.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1262.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1316","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1316.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1067","title":"SGI MachineInfo CGI 信息泄露漏洞","description":"SGI MachineInfo CGI 程序默认安装在部分 SGI IRIX Web 服务器上，该程序未对访问权限进行限制，导致远程攻击者可直接通过 HTTP 请求获取目标主机的系统状态信息，包括进程列表、网络连接、系统负载等敏感数据，从而为后续渗透攻击提供情报支撑。该漏洞攻击门槛低，仅需网络可达即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1067"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-05-07T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"删除或重命名 SGI Web 服务器上的 MachineInfo CGI 脚本（通常位于 /cgi-bin/machineinfo），或通过 Web 服务器配置限制仅允许可信任 IP 访问；升级 SGI IRIX 操作系统至 6.5 以上版本以移除默认安装的该 CGI 程序；如业务不需要此功能，直接移除该脚本文件以彻底消除信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420919&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1316.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1316.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1316.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0100","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0039","title":"SGI IRIX webdist.cgi 命令执行漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.3 的 webdist.cgi 程序存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者通过在 distloc 参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符），即可绕过输入过滤执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.3 版本，攻击无需身份认证，仅需向目标 Web 服务发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发，可导致服务器被完全控制。CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0039"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-05-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:25Z","remediation":"建议从 SGI 安全公告 19970501-02-PX 获取并安装对应 IRIX 版本的补丁。如无法立即打补丁，应删除或禁用 CGI 目录下的 webdist.cgi 程序，并确保 webdist 服务已停止。对于仍在使用 SGI IRIX 的系统，建议迁移至受支持的操作系统，因为 IRIX 已于 2006 年 12 月停止技术支持，不再提供安全更新。",